# Only application/build inputs enter Docker's context. In particular,
# deployment/windows/runtime (settings.env, diagnostics), backups, Git history
# and arbitrary files placed at the repository root must stay on the host.
# Keep this list in sync with BOTH Dockerfiles and the packaging regression test.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!LICENSE
!run_api.py
!api/
!api/**
!commands/
!commands/**
!open_notebook/
!open_notebook/**
!prompts/
!prompts/**
!configs/
!configs/archival/
!configs/archival/seed_transformations.json
!frontend/
!frontend/**
!scripts/
!scripts/wait-for-api.sh
!supervisord.conf
!supervisord.single.conf

# Local configuration and artifacts are excluded even INSIDE an allowed tree.
# These rules deliberately follow all inclusions. Supply secrets at runtime.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.netrc
**/.ssh
**/.aws
**/runtime
**/backups
**/diagnostico*.txt
**/*.log
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/data
**/mydata
**/notebook_data
**/surreal_data
**/surreal-data
**/surreal_single_data
**/tmp

# Build products, dependencies and development tooling are rebuilt in Docker.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/out
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/*.egg-info
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.antigravity
**/.gemini
**/.claude
**/.codex
**/CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
